480-### 8.2 Eval set design principles
481-
482-An eval set should represent:
483-- critical user tasks
484-- common tasks
485-- high-risk tasks
486-- edge cases
487-- failure-prone scenarios
488:- drift-sensitive scenarios
489-- rollout-sensitive scenarios
