1002-- whether no critical pattern has become weak or missing after rewrite
1003:- whether traceability between pattern and owner remains legible
1004-- whether host-runtime carryover in `AGENTS.md`, guides, and skills still reflects the active control surfaces faithfully
1005-- whether compact packet families still cover the dominant tool / retrieval / memory / lifecycle / audit boundaries
1006-- whether compact packet families still cover the dominant goal / recovery / approval / budget / prioritization control-loop boundaries
