1010-- planning semantics weakened in compressed variants
1011:- reasoning-technique doctrine disappears from its owner
1012-- adaptation semantics collapse into memory-only wording
1013-- MCP wording disappears into generic tool language
1014-- prompt-stack release evaluation not represented anywhere after rewrite
1015-- host-runtime guides lose packet lookup or reroute cues that active users rely on
1016-- a control boundary exists in doctrine but no longer has a reusable packet family in the example layer
1017:- guide and runtime lookup surfaces drift on goal / recovery / approval / budget / priority packet families
1018-- a control-loop packet remains in examples or one skill but disappears from the operator guide, runtime guide, or peer skills
1019-
1020-### 20.3 Coverage rule
1021-A version that improves prose but drops owned capability coverage is not an improvement.
